<title>UK: Harris buys Daniels Pharm from Gehe.</title>
<headline>Harris buys Daniels Pharm from Gehe.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philip Harris Plc said on Friday that it has agreed to buy a business called Daniels Pharmaceuticals from German pharmaceutical wholesaler Gehe AG .</p>
<p>It said in a statement that it will pay 325,000 stg for the business, plus an agreed valuation estimated at 225,000. The company will also buy stock of up to a maximum 2.3 million.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
